graph TB
    subgraph MCPServer["RHOAI MCP Server (FastMCP)"]
        direction TB
        Server["MCP Server<br/>(server.py)"]
        PluginMgr["Plugin Manager<br/>(pluggy)"]
        K8sClient["K8sClient<br/>(kubernetes-python)"]
        OIDCMiddleware["OIDC Auth Middleware<br/>(ASGI)"]
        WorkflowTokens["Workflow Token System<br/>(HMAC-SHA256)"]
        PortForward["Port Forward Manager<br/>(asyncio)"]

        Server -->|registers plugins| PluginMgr
        Server -->|authenticates via| OIDCMiddleware
        PluginMgr -->|uses| K8sClient
        PluginMgr -->|enforces step order| WorkflowTokens
        PluginMgr -->|accesses in-cluster svc| PortForward
    end

    subgraph Plugins["Domain Plugins (14 plugins, 50+ tools)"]
        direction TB
        Projects["projects<br/>(5 tools)"]
        Notebooks["notebooks<br/>(7 tools)"]
        Inference["inference<br/>(12 tools)"]
        Training["training<br/>(10+ tools)"]
        Connections["connections<br/>(4 tools)"]
        Pipelines["pipelines<br/>(3 tools)"]
        Storage["storage<br/>(3 tools)"]
        ModelReg["model_registry<br/>(10 tools)"]
        ClusterComp["cluster-composites<br/>(10 tools)"]
        PlannerComp["planner-composites<br/>(2 tools)"]
        TrainingComp["training-composites<br/>(8 tools)"]
        MetaComp["meta-composites<br/>(2 tools)"]
        Prompts["prompts<br/>(18 prompts)"]
    end

    PluginMgr -->|loads| Plugins

    %% External Interactions
    Agent["AI Agent<br/>(Claude Desktop / Code)"]
    Agent -->|MCP SSE/HTTP<br/>8000/TCP| Server
    Agent -->|stdio| Server

    K8sClient -->|HTTPS 6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API Server"]
    PortForward -->|port-forward| InClusterSvc["In-Cluster Services"]

    %% CRDs consumed
    K8sAPI -->|watches/manages| CRDs["CRDs:<br/>InferenceService<br/>Notebook<br/>TrainJob<br/>DSPA<br/>DSC<br/>AcceleratorProfile"]

    OIDCMiddleware -->|validates tokens| OIDCProvider["OIDC Provider"]
    ModelReg -->|REST API| ModelRegSvc["Model Registry /<br/>Model Catalog"]
    PlannerComp -->|REST API| PlannerSvc["Planner Service"]

    %% Styling
    style MCPServer fill:#e8f4fd,stroke:#4a90e2,stroke-width:2px
    style Plugins fill:#f0f8e8,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px
    style Server fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style PluginMgr fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style K8sClient fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style OIDCMiddleware fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style WorkflowTokens fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style PortForward fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Agent fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#999,stroke-width:2px
    style K8sAPI fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style CRDs fill:#f5a623,color:#333
    style OIDCProvider fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style ModelRegSvc fill:#7ed321,color:#333
    style PlannerSvc fill:#7ed321,color:#333
    style InClusterSvc fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
